{"message":"fix(forum): reply-to-post was unreachable -- ThreadPanel had no composer\n\nthreadManager.replyToForumPost existed but had zero live caller: the SDK's\nThreadPanel (anentrypoint-design) only ever rendered select/create/close,\nnever a reply composer. Fixed upstream (design@4dd1332) by adding an onReply\nprop to ThreadPanel; wire it here via a new replyToThread adapter action,\nand make replyToForumPost re-sync state.threads after publish so a sent\nreply appears without needing to re-select the post.\n\nAlso fixed the marketing landing's stale wireweave npm link -- AGENTS.md\ndocuments wireweave has carried zero npm presence since the CDN-independence\nmigration; the tech-details table still linked npmjs.com and claimed npm\ndelivery. Points at the GitHub repo now, matching how it's actually loaded.\n\nSESSION_ID=pages-forum-landing-1789939891","paths":["docs/index.html","docs/js/nostr-adapter.js","docs/js/threads.js"],"SESSION_ID":"pages-forum-landing-1789939891"}
